From 94967e6d581ecd6c08c4ad4e1ae0f82cc6a0a917 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Kamil=20Postro=C5=BCny?= <kamil@postrozny.pl>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 10:37:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dxvk: scoped descriptor elapsed diagnostics, default off

Track same-thread inclusive/exclusive descriptor regions and separate standalone pool work. Checked raw elapsed clocks and full per-device cumulative snapshots are diagnostics, not CPU attribution or descriptor-buffer enablement.

Class: diagnostics
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-23-dxvk-descriptor-cost-probe-host.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
